step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Let's start with a simple robust baseline – the mean over the full model pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error weights to see if it outperforms the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it improves over weighted inverse error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if removing extremes improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by evaluating ONLY_DWT_catboost alone.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_DWT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 on the full pool to see if it beats the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a robust dba combination on the full pool to see if it beats the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse-error combination on a smaller, high-performing pool (pool1) to see if focusing on the top models improves over the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse-error combination on the full pool to see if it beats the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if reducing variance helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse-error combination on the more stable pool1 to see if it can beat the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if reducing variance helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the moderate‑size pool2 to see if removing extremes helps over the current best median pool1.  

Action: evaluate_strategy  

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool2","trim_pct":0.2}

